names, and Dylan's gods-343.txt spoiler has them, with some extra
explanation at the Annotated Nethack File :

http://www.spod-central.org/~psmith/nh/anhf.html

The anhf has Moloch and Marduk, too, which is cool.

However, one small addition that I didn't notice is Elbereth (as in
